{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wendi-e-p026a","title":"刘廙等据图纬上言魏受命","accounts":[{"id":"wendi-e-p026a-account","label":"裴注·献帝传","text":"刘廙等据图纬上言魏受命","evidence":["wendi-e-p026a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wendi-p0070","role":"奏议","evidence":["wendi-e-p026a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0203","role":"奏议","evidence":["wendi-e-p026a-q"]},{"person":"wendi-p0071","role":"奏议","evidence":["wendi-e-p026a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0395","role":"奏议","evidence":["wendi-e-p026a-q"]},{"person":"wendi-p0072","role":"奏议","evidence":["wendi-e-p026a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0394","role":"奏议","evidence":["wendi-e-p026a-q"]},{"person":"wendi-p0073","role":"奏议","evidence":["wendi-e-p026a-q"]},{"person":"wendi-p0074","role":"奏议","evidence":["wendi-e-p026a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":220,"label":"延康元年受禅前","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wendi-y220","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wendi-q-o002","basis":"延康元年受禅前"},"evidence":["wendi-e-p026a-q","wendi-q-o002","wendi-q-o019","wendi-q-b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04"]},"ordering_evidence":"wendi-e-p026a-q","source_order":[2,139,"P026a"],"order":514}],"persons":[{"id":"wendi-p0070","name":"刘廙","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wendi-p0071","name":"刘晔","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wendi-p0072","name":"陈矫","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wendi-p0073","name":"王毖","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wendi-p0074","name":"董遇","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0203","name":"辛毗","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0394","name":"陈群","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0395","name":"桓阶","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wendi-e-p026a-q","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-f36fcb40ad26bc398b66","layer":"pei","quote":"魏王侍中刘廙、辛毗、刘晔，尚书令桓阶，尚书陈矫、陈群，给事黄门侍郎王毖、董遇等言：“臣伏读左中郎将李伏上事。考图纬之言，以效神明之应；稽之古代，未有不然者也。故尧称历数在躬，璇玑以明天道；周武未战，而赤乌衔书；汉祖未兆，而神母告符；孝宣仄微，字成木叶；光武布衣，名已勒谶。是天之所命以著圣哲，非有言语之声、芬芳之臭可得而知也；徒悬象以示人，微物以效意耳。自汉德之衰，渐染数世；桓、灵之末，皇极不建；暨于大乱，二十余年。天之不泯，诞生明圣，以济其难；是以符谶先著，以彰至德。殿下践阼未期，而灵象变于上，群瑞应于下；四方不羁之民，归心向义，唯惧在后：虽典籍所传，未若今之盛也。臣妾远近，莫不凫藻。”","attribution":"裴注·献帝传","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":138,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-fc6f9c6942b5c231c294","start":0,"end":297,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：黄初二年（公元 221）。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":210,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-8fff547b113ffa36bbc1","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-o002","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-1c3ea4f0ea338bf2ec5a","layer":"original","quote":"太祖崩，嗣位为丞相，魏王。﹝三﹞尊王后曰王太后〖5〗。改建安二十五年为延康元年。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":40,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-o019","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-8820e5c7f9006d364c44","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖1〗，郊祀天地、明堂〖2〗。甲戌〖3〗，校猎至原陵〖4〗。遣使者，以太牢祠汉世祖〖5〗。乙亥〖6〗，朝日于东郊〖7〗。﹝一﹞初令郡国口满十万者〖8〗，岁察孝廉一人；其有秀异〖9〗，无拘户口。辛巳〖10〗，分三公户邑，封子弟各一人为列侯。壬午〖11〗，复颍川郡一年田租〖12〗。﹝二﹞改许县为许昌县。以魏郡东部为阳平郡〖13〗，西部为广平郡〖14〗。﹝三﹞","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":208,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":183,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
